      "body": "Fixes #31414\n\n**Purpose**\nThis PR resolves the naming confusion between `vllm.utils.flashinfer` and `vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization.utils.flashinfer_utils` by renaming the latter to `flashinfer_moe.py`. Since the utilities in this file are strictly MoE-specific (e.g. `FlashinferMoeBackend`, weight layout conversions for FP4/FP8 MoE), renaming it to `flashinfer_moe.py` makes its scope obvious and avoids mixing general flashinfer utilities with MoE-specific ones. This implements Option 2 from the issue discussion. All import sites have been updated accordingly.\n\n**Test Plan**\nRan `pre-commit` (including `mypy`) which verified that all imports resolve correctly and no syntax errors were introduced.\n\n**Test Result**\nPassed",
